cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AUTOMA GP in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "AutomaGP"
abstract: >-
  A symbolic planner for a personal computer. Means-Ends Analysis in
  Common Lisp (SBCL) over a context of symbolic facts, with multilevel
  memory, a deliberative trace for explanation, opt-in operating-system
  adapters, and a policy gate that decides whether a plan is only
  simulated or executed.
authors:
